+  The configuration's term doesn't unify with the destination's term and the
+  configuration cannot be rewritten further.
+  <k>
+    str ( iCons ( 87 , iCons ( 82 , iCons ( 79 , iCons ( 78 ,
+      iCons ( 71 , iCons ( 32 , iCons ( 49 , .IntSeq ) ) ) ) ) ) ) ) ~> .K
+  </k>
+  ...
+  closureVal(... Assign(Name("result"), Str("WRONG")) ..., 0)
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
+
+The code sequence 87,82,79,78,71,32,49 is "WRONG 1".
